---
import Section from '../ui/Section.astro';
import Badge from '../ui/Badge.astro';
---

<Section id="social-proof" className="border-y border-border/50 bg-secondary/5">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center mb-16">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground sm:text-5xl text-balance mb-6">
      Ya confían en Tally
    </h2>
    <p class="text-xl text-muted-foreground text-balance">
      Desde cafeterías boutique hasta cadenas en expansión.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Marquee with fade masks -->
  <div class="relative w-full overflow-hidden mb-24 mask-linear-fade">
      <div class="flex gap-12 animate-scroll-infinite w-max">
          {[...Array(2)].map(() => (
              <div class="flex gap-12 items-center">
                 {['La Taberna del Puerto', 'Café Modernist', 'Pizzería Napoli', 'Sushi Zen', 'Burger House', 'Paella & Mar', 'Bistro 1984', 'El Café de la Esquina'].map((name) => (
                    <div class="text-2xl font-serif font-bold text-muted-foreground/40 whitespace-nowrap hover:text-foreground transition-colors cursor-default">
                        {name}
                    </div>
                 ))}
              </div>
          ))}
      </div>
      <!-- Gradients for fade effect -->
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 left-0 w-24 bg-linear-to-r from-background to-transparent z-10"></div>
      <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-0 w-24 bg-linear-to-l from-background to-transparent z-10"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- Testimonials Grid -->
  <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <!-- MASONRY CARDS -->
      <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-tomato">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-foreground mb-6 leading-relaxed">
             "Nuestros camareros tardaban 10 minutos por mesa. Ahora son 2. <span class="text-foreground font-semibold bg-(--tomato)/10 px-1 rounded">Tally se pagó solo</span> en la primera semana."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-muted flex items-center justify-center font-serif font-bold text-muted-foreground">CM</div>
              <div>
                  <div class="font-medium">Carlos M.</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">La Taberna del Puerto</div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>

       <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-tomato">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-foreground mb-6 leading-relaxed">
             "El split de cuenta es mágico. Grupos grandes ya no son un problema. <span class="bg-(--blueberry)/10 text-foreground font-semibold px-1 rounded">Propinas +40%</span>."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-muted flex items-center justify-center font-serif font-bold text-muted-foreground">AR</div>
              <div>
                  <div class="font-medium">Ana R.</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Café Modernist</div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>

       <div class="group relative p-8 rounded-3xl bg-card border border-border/50 shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl hover:-translate-y-1 transition-all duration-300">
          <div class="flex gap-1 mb-4 text-tomato">
              {[...Array(5)].map(() => (
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 20 20"><path d="M9.049 2.927c.3-.921 1.603-.921 1.902 0l1.07 3.292a1 1 0 00.95.69h3.462c.969 0 1.371 1.24.588 1.81l-2.8 2.034a1 1 0 00-.364 1.118l1.07 3.292c.3.921-.755 1.688-1.54 1.118l-2.8-2.034a1 1 0 00-1.175 0l-2.8 2.034c-.784.57-1.838-.197-1.539-1.118l1.07-3.292a1 1 0 00-.364-1.118L2.98 8.72c-.783-.57-.38-1.81.588-1.81h3.461a1 1 0 00.951-.69l1.07-3.292z"/></svg>
              ))}
          </div>
          <p class="text-lg text-foreground mb-6 leading-relaxed">
             "Implementación en 1 hora. Sin formación necesaria, el equipo lo usó desde el primer día."
          </p>
          <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-muted flex items-center justify-center font-serif font-bold text-muted-foreground">MS</div>
              <div>
                  <div class="font-medium">Miguel S.</div>
                  <div class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">Pizzería Napoli</div>
              </div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</Section>

<style>
  @keyframes scroll-infinite {
    0% {
      transform: translateX(0);
    }
    100% {
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }
  }

  .animate-scroll-infinite {
    animation: scroll-infinite 40s linear infinite;
  }

  .animate-scroll-infinite:hover {
      animation-play-state: paused;
  }
</style>
